    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did the right thing. i spoke up about the fraud at the firm and now i've lost everything. they blacklisted me, my friends won't even take my calls because they're scared of being associated with me, and i'm just... sitting here in this empty apartment. i feel like i traded my entire life for a moral high ground that doesn't even exist. nothing is left.",
